":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk44/seasons/cc822f38-90ee-4161-a4c1-9d0e5eeb255d.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk57/seasons/aca574ce-8f32-4628-a295-4cee39e71406.png","likes":22,"dislikes":0,"views":3003,"release_date":"1511222400000","season_number":1,"description":"Where the Lost Ones Go tells the story of the first love of young art student which lead to a lifetime of unforgetable love. Ye Zi, a major in chinese art painting and Xiang Ze Yi, a major in oil painting met and fell in love in college. However Ye Zi was heart-broken when Xiang Ze Yi suddenly left without a word. Years later, Ye Zi became a famous manga illustrator. Inhope of getting back together again, Xiang Ze Yi came back with a confession of what happened and why he had to leave. How will Ye Zi decide?","rating":{"sources":[],"value":0,"age":""},"current_season_id":8592,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}